          "html": "<grammarly-extension data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible !important; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -2.97619px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\" class=\"dnXmp\"></grammarly-extension><grammarly-extension data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible !important; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -2.97619px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\" class=\"dnXmp\"></grammarly-extension><div class=\"eb-block-drag\" title=\"拖曳移動區塊\">⠿</div>\n        <div class=\"eb-ctrl\">\n          <span class=\"eb-ctrl-tag\">標題</span>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"moveBlock('eb-1',-1,event)\">↑</button>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"moveBlock('eb-1',1,event)\">↓</button>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn del\" onclick=\"deleteBlock('eb-1',event)\">✕</button>\n        </div>\n        <h2 contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-placeholder=\"標題文字\" data-listener-added_369fa667=\"true\" data-zh=\"當你的眼神開始驅動另一張臉\" data-en=\"When Your Gaze Starts Driving Another Face\">當你的眼神開始驅動另一張臉</h2>\n      "
        },
        {
          "type": "文字",
          "html": "<grammarly-extension data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible !important; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -2.97619px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\" class=\"dnXmp\"></grammarly-extension><grammarly-extension data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible !important; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -2.97619px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\" class=\"dnXmp\"></grammarly-extension><div class=\"eb-block-drag\" title=\"拖曳移動區塊\">⠿</div>\n        <div class=\"eb-ctrl\">\n          <span class=\"eb-ctrl-tag\">文字</span>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"moveBlock('eb-2',-1,event)\">↑</button>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"moveBlock('eb-2',1,event)\">↓</button>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn del\" onclick=\"deleteBlock('eb-2',event)\">✕</button>\n        </div>\n        <div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-placeholder=\"輸入段落文字…\" data-listener-added_369fa667=\"true\" data-zh=\"&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;《狐狸軍師與他的血海》是一件實驗性的互動角色概念作品,也是我驗證自創「網頁插畫藝術」的第一件成品。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;它同時是藝術品、互動裝置與網站——任何單一分類都難以定義它。&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;我將這類網站定義為一種全新的「互動裝置」:從手機到電腦皆可作為載體,具高度傳播性與沉浸感,讓觀者無論身處偏遠或老少,都能親身與藝術互動,不必耗費大量成本與空間搭建場地,藉此打破距離與年齡的隔閡。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;目前的網頁大多用於介紹、遊戲或電子繪本,鮮少有人將網頁純粹視為一件互動藝術品;這件作品正是這種跨領域的實驗,也是我對「藝術載體還能是什麼」的一次提問。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;我的目標是:讓大家聽到「互動設計」「互動藝術」時,不必再脫口而出「那是什麼?」 作品透過臉部辨識,讓觀者以眨眼、臉部與滑鼠移動即時操控畫面視角與角色,並可於電腦端調整血海、瞳孔、煙霧等細節。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\" data-en=\"&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;\"Fox Strategist and His Sea of Blood\" is an experimental interactive character concept piece, and the first work through which I tested my own invented practice of \"web illustration art.\"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;It is simultaneously an artwork, an interactive installation, and a website — no single category can quite contain it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;I define this kind of website as an entirely new form of \"interactive installation\": it can run on anything from a phone to a desktop computer, carries high reach and immersion, and lets viewers — however remote or however old — interact with art in person, without the cost or space of building a physical venue, breaking down the barriers of distance and age.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;Most websites today are built for introductions, games, or picture-book-style storytelling; few people treat the web itself as a pure interactive artwork. This piece is exactly that kind of cross-disciplinary experiment — my own attempt to ask what else an \"art medium\" could be.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"&gt;My goal is this: when people hear \"interactive design\" or \"interactive art,\" I don’t want their first reaction to be \"what’s that?\" The piece uses facial recognition, letting viewers control the camera angle and the character in real time through blinking, facial movement, and mouse movement, with the sea of blood, pupils, smoke, and other details adjustable on desktop.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\" data-listener-added_c1ce1dce=\"true\" data-listener-added_12aa2ddc=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\">《狐狸軍師與他的血海》是一件實驗性的互動角色概念作品,也是我驗證自創「網頁插畫藝術」的第一件成品。</span><div><span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\">它同時是藝術品、互動裝置與網站——任何單一分類都難以定義它。&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\">我將這類網站定義為一種全新的「互動裝置」:從手機到電腦皆可作為載體,具高度傳播性與沉浸感,讓觀者無論身處偏遠或老少,都能親身與藝術互動,不必耗費大量成本與空間搭建場地,藉此打破距離與年齡的隔閡。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\">目前的網頁大多用於介紹、遊戲或電子繪本,鮮少有人將網頁純粹視為一件互動藝術品;這件作品正是這種跨領域的實驗,也是我對「藝術載體還能是什麼」的一次提問。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 23.92px;\">我的目標是:讓大家聽到「互動設計」「互動藝術」時,不必再脫口而出「那是什麼?」 作品透過臉部辨識,讓觀者以眨眼、臉部與滑鼠移動即時操控畫面視角與角色,並可於電腦端調整血海、瞳孔、煙霧等細節。</span></div></div>\n      "
        },
